.
.  Generate sample output for Cauchy PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na caupdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Cauchy PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT CAUPDF(X) FOR X = -5 0.01 5
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CAUPDF.PS caupdf.ps
.
quit
